  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Recognised Seasonal Employer scheme Worker Training Programme, Phase 3</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RSE WTP Phase III will&#xa0;deliver an &#x2018;Essential Learning&#x2019; course for first-time RSE WTP participants. This supports the development of skills to enable workers to maximise their participation in the scheme and address common issues faced by RSE workers in New&#xa0;Zealand.&#xa0;Following completion of Essential Learning, returning participants have opportunities to access elective vocational courses focused on skills that contribute to their reintegration in their home countries.</narrative>
  </description>
